codex
Round 2 will refine the successful decomposition while changing one structural choice at a time:

- H2a: the 6 mm descent gate is wider than the 2.5 mm centering predicate and may reward descending into the socket rim; tightening only that gate to 3 mm should improve final insertion.
- H2b: the hard gate may create a discontinuity. Replacing it with a smooth multiplicative coupling between lateral precision and depth proximity, normalized to the same maximum depth reward, should provide safer gradients.

The 0.53125 recipe is preserved in the research record and can be restored if both variants regress.
