codex
Round 29 confirms depth rate exactly 60: rates 50 and 70 score 508/1024 and 471/1024.

The current graph still inherits a unit engagement bonus at the relatively shallow 22.5 mm height. With the stronger 3 mm centering curriculum, that plateau may now be over- or under-valued. Round 30 will isolate engagement weight 0.5 versus 1.5 while leaving success at 1 and restoring every other winning parameter.
